## Slot vocabulary ({{slot-count}} slots inherited or declared)

Task memorials inherit `:mm/Memory` plus type-specific required slots:

- **`status`** (required) — `pending` / `active` / `blocked` / `done` / `dropped`
- **`priority`** (required) — `low` / `medium` / `high` / `urgent`
- **`effort`** (required) — `trivial` / `small` / `medium` / `large` / `capstone`
- **`triggered-by`** — origin context (Dan-directive / arc / inbox promotion / prior task)
- **`blockers`** — first-class list; each blocker is either prose or a path to memorial / resource that must be resolved
- **`parent`** — arc-forest DAG field; which arc(s) this task belongs under

